1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,469
Hello, this is Mira from the school
office.

2
00:00:03,469 --> 00:00:08,794
I wanted to remind you about the
parent-teacher meeting next week.

3
00:00:08,794 --> 00:00:12,990
It will be held on Tuesday at 4 PM in the
main hall.

4
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,661
Please bring your child's report card with
you.

5
00:00:16,661 --> 00:00:19,582
If you are unable to attend on Tuesday,

6
00:00:19,582 --> 00:00:24,900
you may meet with the class teacher on
Thursday between 9 am and 11 am.

7
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:31,083
We will also discuss the annual visit to
the Science Museum which costs two hundred

8
00:00:31,083 --> 00:00:37,030
rupees per student and the last date for
payment of fees is the twentieth of this

9
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:37,470
month.

10
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:44,661
Students should wear their school uniform
and bring their lunch box to the trip,

11
00:00:44,661 --> 00:00:49,080
which will depart from the school gate at
7:30 AM.

12
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:52,451
And will be back by 5 PM, thank you.

13
00:00:52,451 --> 00:00:57,372
And if you have any questions, please call
the office.
